(5778585, 841209, 75618, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, the first thing I noticed was "amphetamine" and thought it was relating to drug addicts of some sort. And then I looked at the other page haha.... Anyway, I''ve seen a similar picture on this site before and the execution was better. Good effort though.</td>', 'I have to admit, the first thing I noticed was "amphetamine" and thought it was relating to drug addicts of some sort. And then I looked at the other page haha.... Anyway, I''ve seen a similar picture on this site before and the execution was better. Good effort though.', '2009-12-23 00:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
