(5778640, 840540, 107027, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!!  I love this photo and I just saw the ratatoullie last night so maybe I''m just in love with cheese as well!</td>', 'This is amazing!!  I love this photo and I just saw the ratatoullie last night so maybe I''m just in love with cheese as well!', '2009-12-23 01:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778656, 841016, 61921, '<td valign="top">This is an Amazing shot i love it the lighting is good and the setting really makes the photo. Great job</td>', 'This is an Amazing shot i love it the lighting is good and the setting really makes the photo. Great job', '2009-12-23 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778657, 841253, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is underexposed.  The "white" dog is actually middle to light gray.  Otherwise, it''s a nice capture of the moment.</td>', 'This is underexposed.  The "white" dog is actually middle to light gray.  Otherwise, it''s a nice capture of the moment.', '2009-12-23 01:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778658, 841109, 61921, '<td valign="top">Good Lighting Beautiful models, and good concept</td>', 'Good Lighting Beautiful models, and good concept', '2009-12-23 01:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778664, 840708, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like this image but I see some points that can be improved.  It looks to me like the focus is more on his near arm than his face.  The background is also a few stops too hot--it''s bleeding onto the boy, blowing out the highlights on his shirt and arms and creating a strange glow around his head.  The boys pose looks relaxed, but his expression looks more sad or pained than loving or protecting.  I also might put a reflector or bounce card camera right to give a nice catchlight in his eyes and provide a bit of directional light on his face.</td>', 'I like this image but I see some points that can be improved.  It looks to me like the focus is more on his near arm than his face.  The background is also a few stops too hot--it''s bleeding onto the boy, blowing out the highlights on his shirt and arms and creating a strange glow around his head.  The boys pose looks relaxed, but his expression looks more sad or pained than loving or protecting.  I also might put a reflector or bounce card camera right to give a nice catchlight in his eyes and provide a bit of directional light on his face.', '2009-12-23 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778666, 841232, 47470, '<td valign="top">The tight crop and shallow depth of field made me think this was weird bread or cheese.  I don''t think I would have known this was a pumpkin without the title (and my family used to grow pumpkins!).  Otherwise, the colors are very nice and the bokeh add a lovely soft touch.</td>', 'The tight crop and shallow depth of field made me think this was weird bread or cheese.  I don''t think I would have known this was a pumpkin without the title (and my family used to grow pumpkins!).  Otherwise, the colors are very nice and the bokeh add a lovely soft touch.', '2009-12-23 01:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778669, 840995, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  They look so happy!  I only wish there was a little more light on their faces.</td>', 'Nice capture!  They look so happy!  I only wish there was a little more light on their faces.', '2009-12-23 01:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778671, 841230, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love that the background is blurred out enough to make the bird pop, but not too much that the scene is obliterated.  The perspective makes the house look like it''s the perfect size for the bird, and that reminds me of a scene from a fairytale.</td>', 'I love that the background is blurred out enough to make the bird pop, but not too much that the scene is obliterated.  The perspective makes the house look like it''s the perfect size for the bird, and that reminds me of a scene from a fairytale.', '2009-12-23 01:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778672, 841115, 47470, '<td valign="top">Food photography is pretty hard to do, but this looks absolutely scrumptious!  The shadows and the darker color of the ribbons in the corners creates a natural vignette too.</td>', 'Food photography is pretty hard to do, but this looks absolutely scrumptious!  The shadows and the darker color of the ribbons in the corners creates a natural vignette too.', '2009-12-23 01:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778674, 841261, 47470, '<td valign="top">The centered composition works very well with this.  I can''t decide on the border though.  It does emphasize the black of its eye, but it seems so heavy too.</td>', 'The centered composition works very well with this.  I can''t decide on the border though.  It does emphasize the black of its eye, but it seems so heavy too.', '2009-12-23 01:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778676, 841050, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the border is too heavy.  It only emphasizes how dark the image is.  I''d like to bump up the exposure to bring out a little more detail.  I do like how the couple fits so well in the scene.</td>', 'I think the border is too heavy.  It only emphasizes how dark the image is.  I''d like to bump up the exposure to bring out a little more detail.  I do like how the couple fits so well in the scene.', '2009-12-23 01:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778679, 841255, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful and intriguing image, but without the title, I don''t think this conveys the challenge topic as well as I''d prefer.  Her expression seems wistful, maybe even borderline indifferent, but not loving or love inspiring.  But like I said, I like this image anyway.  The light is interesting and I''m a fan of the muted colors.</td>', 'This is a very beautiful and intriguing image, but without the title, I don''t think this conveys the challenge topic as well as I''d prefer.  Her expression seems wistful, maybe even borderline indifferent, but not loving or love inspiring.  But like I said, I like this image anyway.  The light is interesting and I''m a fan of the muted colors.', '2009-12-23 01:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778683, 840540, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the ungroomed-ness of the mouse''s fur gives off a slightly "diseased" feeling (usually only sick animals don''t groom).  I think that takes away from what could be an absolutely adorable image.  The idea is great and the moment is perfect--the mouse''s expression is cute and he seems very possessive of his cheese : )</td>', 'I think the ungroomed-ness of the mouse''s fur gives off a slightly "diseased" feeling (usually only sick animals don''t groom).  I think that takes away from what could be an absolutely adorable image.  The idea is great and the moment is perfect--the mouse''s expression is cute and he seems very possessive of his cheese : )', '2009-12-23 02:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778684, 841276, 113068, '<td valign="top">Ummmm</td>', 'Ummmm', '2009-12-23 02:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778689, 841075, 47470, '<td valign="top">The drop looks great, but I think this idea would have worked better under the Advanced rule set so you could spot edit the chocolate to make it look soft, luscious, and satiny.</td>', 'The drop looks great, but I think this idea would have worked better under the Advanced rule set so you could spot edit the chocolate to make it look soft, luscious, and satiny.', '2009-12-23 02:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778694, 841074, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the pose, but I wish there was a little more light on her face.  Pull her away from the background and use a shallower depth of field would to turn the background into soft tones (and help hide the wrinkles!).</td>', 'I love the pose, but I wish there was a little more light on her face.  Pull her away from the background and use a shallower depth of field would to turn the background into soft tones (and help hide the wrinkles!).', '2009-12-23 02:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778695, 841053, 69450, '<td valign="top">would have liked a deeper depth of field and cleaner nails!</td>', 'would have liked a deeper depth of field and cleaner nails!', '2009-12-23 02:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778698, 841242, 47470, '<td valign="top">Lighting them from below (which is called "monster light" for a reason!) unfortunately counteracts any feelings of love in the image.  The light creates dark bags under their eyes and ominous shadows behind them.  The dark clothing doesn''t help the mood either.</td>', 'Lighting them from below (which is called "monster light" for a reason!) unfortunately counteracts any feelings of love in the image.  The light creates dark bags under their eyes and ominous shadows behind them.  The dark clothing doesn''t help the mood either.', '2009-12-23 02:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778701, 841252, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light on their faces looks great.  I love how the light falls off right at the edge of the frame on the left.  I think the hair light (particularly on the girl) is too bright and there should be a little more light on the boy''s pants so he doesn''t blend in with the background so much.  Otherwise, great capture of their expressions.</td>', 'The light on their faces looks great.  I love how the light falls off right at the edge of the frame on the left.  I think the hair light (particularly on the girl) is too bright and there should be a little more light on the boy''s pants so he doesn''t blend in with the background so much.  Otherwise, great capture of their expressions.', '2009-12-23 02:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778702, 841115, 60173, '<td valign="top">I admire your composition. The ribbons on the angles are brilliant.</td>', 'I admire your composition. The ribbons on the angles are brilliant.', '2009-12-23 02:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778704, 841272, 69450, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this with a closer, vertical crop on the pair.  I think that would have had more impact.  Good shot though! 7</td>', 'I would have liked to see this with a closer, vertical crop on the pair.  I think that would have had more impact.  Good shot though! 7', '2009-12-23 02:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778707, 841219, 69450, '<td valign="top">a cool idea but all that blurring is annoying me more than anything and the background is too grey.  5.  If this were executed right it would have been 7 or 8.</td>', 'a cool idea but all that blurring is annoying me more than anything and the background is too grey.  5.  If this were executed right it would have been 7 or 8.', '2009-12-23 02:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778709, 841016, 69450, '<td valign="top">LOVE the decisive moment. 8</td>', 'LOVE the decisive moment. 8', '2009-12-23 02:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778710, 840595, 47470, '<td valign="top">She has an incredible face.  I''m not sure if it''s the camera or the processing (based on the great lighting, I''m going with processing), but it looks like there was a fair amount of data loss, which hurts the quality.  There also appears to be a lot of chromatic abberation (particularly noticeable in the heavy cyan halo on the top right side of her head).  It''s too bad about the quality because this is an otherwise great image!</td>', 'She has an incredible face.  I''m not sure if it''s the camera or the processing (based on the great lighting, I''m going with processing), but it looks like there was a fair amount of data loss, which hurts the quality.  There also appears to be a lot of chromatic abberation (particularly noticeable in the heavy cyan halo on the top right side of her head).  It''s too bad about the quality because this is an otherwise great image!', '2009-12-23 02:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778711, 841195, 69450, '<td valign="top">his look: "Baby, are you ready to go back to the hotel room?"<br/>her look: "I''m tired"<br/>I don''t get love from this shot but more peevishness.</td>', 'his look: "Baby, are you ready to go back to the hotel room?"her look: "I''m tired"I don''t get love from this shot but more peevishness.', '2009-12-23 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778712, 840708, 69450, '<td valign="top">that cat is gorgeous!</td>', 'that cat is gorgeous!', '2009-12-23 02:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778714, 840961, 69450, '<td valign="top">The Leafs sure aren''t loving the game these days!</td>', 'The Leafs sure aren''t loving the game these days!', '2009-12-23 02:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778717, 840660, 113068, '<td valign="top">Love the eyes!</td>', 'Love the eyes!', '2009-12-23 02:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
