(5778753, 840707, 108580, '<td valign="top">Emotive image telling a story. Not sure of the love aspect but sharp shot and appealing colours and light.</td>', 'Emotive image telling a story. Not sure of the love aspect but sharp shot and appealing colours and light.', '2009-12-23 02:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778761, 841050, 108580, '<td valign="top">Unique and minimalist in a challenge filled with formulae and pets.<br/>Well done for your effort in photography. Perhaps a bit dark to do well on DPC but a great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Unique and minimalist in a challenge filled with formulae and pets.Well done for your effort in photography. Perhaps a bit dark to do well on DPC but a great shot nonetheless.', '2009-12-23 03:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778826, 841255, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and composition</td>', 'Lovely lighting and composition', '2009-12-23 03:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778843, 841073, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice image, setup, composition, thoughtfullness in a challenge where boredom and formulae abound.</td>', 'Nice image, setup, composition, thoughtfullness in a challenge where boredom and formulae abound.', '2009-12-23 04:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778864, 841142, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great still life.</td>', 'Great still life.', '2009-12-23 04:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778873, 841109, 99506, '<td valign="top">great take on the challenge and an excellent setup. I fear the very subject matter may cause it to bomb on here but I do hope not.</td>', 'great take on the challenge and an excellent setup. I fear the very subject matter may cause it to bomb on here but I do hope not.', '2009-12-23 04:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778887, 840590, 51112, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I think the processing does not match the subject, it is better suited perhaps to glamour models and not poor kids</td>', 'Sorry but I think the processing does not match the subject, it is better suited perhaps to glamour models and not poor kids', '2009-12-23 04:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778893, 841053, 104841, '<td valign="top">sorry but i see this as more of a spooky shot, with the  dirty thumb and the smoke. Otherwise it is nicely composed, I would have tried for a bit more detail in the hand or tweak down the reds a touch.</td>', 'sorry but i see this as more of a spooky shot, with the  dirty thumb and the smoke. Otherwise it is nicely composed, I would have tried for a bit more detail in the hand or tweak down the reds a touch.', '2009-12-23 04:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778896, 841050, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice idea behind the shot. Maybe some more fill light on the foreground and the open earth would have improve the shot. The vignette appears to go over the couple as well, so I would have removed it as we want to draw attention to the couple.</td>', 'nice idea behind the shot. Maybe some more fill light on the foreground and the open earth would have improve the shot. The vignette appears to go over the couple as well, so I would have removed it as we want to draw attention to the couple.', '2009-12-23 04:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778898, 841016, 104841, '<td valign="top">really good shot of a happy couple. I don''t thing the back ground adds much to the shot so I would have used a long lens wide open to blur it. I would have also got the lady to tie her hair back so you can see her face if possible.</td>', 'really good shot of a happy couple. I don''t thing the back ground adds much to the shot so I would have used a long lens wide open to blur it. I would have also got the lady to tie her hair back so you can see her face if possible.', '2009-12-23 04:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778900, 841279, 104841, '<td valign="top">The basket here is poorly placed as it just goes over the little girls nose. I don''t know where I would have placed it, does it even have a reason for being there in the first place?</td>', 'The basket here is poorly placed as it just goes over the little girls nose. I don''t know where I would have placed it, does it even have a reason for being there in the first place?', '2009-12-23 04:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778904, 841112, 104841, '<td valign="top">while this shot is sentimental I don''t then it is the best angle. I would have got down lower or used some other angle that you would not normally view the bricks from maybe even include some of the back ground or some one walking by.</td>', 'while this shot is sentimental I don''t then it is the best angle. I would have got down lower or used some other angle that you would not normally view the bricks from maybe even include some of the back ground or some one walking by.', '2009-12-23 05:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778923, 840540, 111729, '<td valign="top">awesome picture....don''t know how you managed to make the mouse stay still for the shot.....but i like cheese too! 10 from me!</td>', 'awesome picture....don''t know how you managed to make the mouse stay still for the shot.....but i like cheese too! 10 from me!', '2009-12-23 05:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5778973, 841143, 105457, '<td valign="top">Good idea to start with. I would have liked it to be on top of a coffee table, in the street, it would make it more citylike. But I liked much the way the ribbons were displayed to make a heart.</td>', 'Good idea to start with. I would have liked it to be on top of a coffee table, in the street, it would make it more citylike. But I liked much the way the ribbons were displayed to make a heart.', '2009-12-23 07:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
