(5779070, 841212, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF control, sharp main subject soft rear subject. Colour might have done it more justice if the candy were red/white? Sorry but the chewed fingernails just don''t do it for me. Still, not as mundane as the cat/dog/ring and book shadow shots!</td>', 'Nice DOF control, sharp main subject soft rear subject. Colour might have done it more justice if the candy were red/white? Sorry but the chewed fingernails just don''t do it for me. Still, not as mundane as the cat/dog/ring and book shadow shots!', '2009-12-23 09:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
