(5779189, 840593, 10785, '<td valign="top">Excellent title, very good image. I am not too fond of the fill flash or the yellow roses in the background. I would say in order to improve upon this, get closer and shoot from above using some better light. The flowers and the babies breath appear to be wilting whic adds greater meaning to the title. Overall a good shot!</td>', 'Excellent title, very good image. I am not too fond of the fill flash or the yellow roses in the background. I would say in order to improve upon this, get closer and shoot from above using some better light. The flowers and the babies breath appear to be wilting whic adds greater meaning to the title. Overall a good shot!', '2009-12-23 10:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
