(5779582, 841109, 52750, '<td valign="top">Not sure a lesbian vampire about to feed translates to "love", but (IMO) the execution here is where I find fault. A lot of mood could have been created if it wasn''t just a stark white shot. Red curtain background, or in a darker bedroom setting with creepy candelabras around, or simply directional lighting to create some mood. Or maybe even something not so cliche when it comes to vampires... a dark alley, parking garage, anything! As it is, it looks like some woman with pointy teeth squeezing the boobs of some drunk chic in front of some bright lights. I guess I just expect more atmosphere when I see vampires attacking naked women lol.<br/> <br/>Don''t get me wrong, I still like the shot. It just looks like every other glamour pic on the web to me and could really have benefited from going the extra mile with a little creative lighting or props. I''m giving it an 8, but only because I had to deduct one point because the vampires hands are in the way.</td>', 'Not sure a lesbian vampire about to feed translates to "love", but (IMO) the execution here is where I find fault. A lot of mood could have been created if it wasn''t just a stark white shot. Red curtain background, or in a darker bedroom setting with creepy candelabras around, or simply directional lighting to create some mood. Or maybe even something not so cliche when it comes to vampires... a dark alley, parking garage, anything! As it is, it looks like some woman with pointy teeth squeezing the boobs of some drunk chic in front of some bright lights. I guess I just expect more atmosphere when I see vampires attacking naked women lol. Don''t get me wrong, I still like the shot. It just looks like every other glamour pic on the web to me and could really have benefited from going the extra mile with a little creative lighting or props. I''m giving it an 8, but only because I had to deduct one point because the vampires hands are in the way.', '2009-12-23 19:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
