(5779716, 840914, 52750, '<td valign="top">The onboard flash doesn''t help. When framing, I find it distracting to see hands and feet unintentionally cut off... either all in or all out, even on stuffed animals. A tighter shot on the faces might have helped.<br/> <br/>But the photo still made me smile.</td>', 'The onboard flash doesn''t help. When framing, I find it distracting to see hands and feet unintentionally cut off... either all in or all out, even on stuffed animals. A tighter shot on the faces might have helped. But the photo still made me smile.', '2009-12-23 21:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5779732, 841209, 52750, '<td valign="top">Shots like this are done so often, I find myself looking at the text being used. <br/> <br/>It''s an interesting shape and love the color, but wish the book being used was recognizable as a romance novel, or maybe music sheets for a love song, or the pages of a photo album showing wedding shots or a couple standing close. With the dictionary page, I find myself looking for the connection in the words visible.. one of which is "Amourette", or as the French to English translator defines: passing fancy.<br/> <br/>So much for the beating as one for me. :)</td>', 'Shots like this are done so often, I find myself looking at the text being used.  It''s an interesting shape and love the color, but wish the book being used was recognizable as a romance novel, or maybe music sheets for a love song, or the pages of a photo album showing wedding shots or a couple standing close. With the dictionary page, I find myself looking for the connection in the words visible.. one of which is "Amourette", or as the French to English translator defines: passing fancy. So much for the beating as one for me. :)', '2009-12-23 21:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
