(5779749, 841142, 10785, '<td valign="top">The very soft and muted colors give this a vintage and almost film like quality. The photo has a yellow color cast to it, which seems to be the reason for the muted feel. There is some shadows at the top where the candlelight hits the wall but the bottom of the photo is very flat. Overall, I like the vintage feel of this still life and think it meets the challenge well. Definitely something out of the ordinary.</td>', 'The very soft and muted colors give this a vintage and almost film like quality. The photo has a yellow color cast to it, which seems to be the reason for the muted feel. There is some shadows at the top where the candlelight hits the wall but the bottom of the photo is very flat. Overall, I like the vintage feel of this still life and think it meets the challenge well. Definitely something out of the ordinary.', '2009-12-23 21:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
