(5780471, 840920, 107519, '<td valign="top">Brilliant moment...</td>', 'Brilliant moment...', '2009-12-24 15:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780578, 841227, 58615, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I like that you chose to not enter something that is human because love can be seen in so many different ways. Georgia Aquarium? :)</td>', 'Nice capture. I like that you chose to not enter something that is human because love can be seen in so many different ways. Georgia Aquarium? :)', '2009-12-24 18:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780583, 841050, 58615, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. I appreciate your subtle approach to love, rather than putting it in our face. Favorite of the challenge. The border is a little much for me but I think you are going for a cinematic feel and it works well. It definitely could pass as a still from a film. Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. I appreciate your subtle approach to love, rather than putting it in our face. Favorite of the challenge. The border is a little much for me but I think you are going for a cinematic feel and it works well. It definitely could pass as a still from a film. Good job.', '2009-12-24 18:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780588, 841247, 111808, '<td valign="top">The little one sleeps and the larger one cuddles, keeps warm and watches out, protecting. There is both a purity and rarity in this kind of honest Love. I like this a lot - the colours, the textures, the thought.</td>', 'The little one sleeps and the larger one cuddles, keeps warm and watches out, protecting. There is both a purity and rarity in this kind of honest Love. I like this a lot - the colours, the textures, the thought.', '2009-12-24 19:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780589, 841052, 111808, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative, simple &amp; nice.</td>', 'Very imaginative, simple & nice.', '2009-12-24 19:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780590, 841016, 111808, '<td valign="top">A young couple, happy &amp; oblivious in their affection for one another, surrounded by the Christmas hustle &amp; bustle of the Big City that never sleeps. There is a vibrant, delightful, kinetic energy about this which gladdens the Heart and the newfallen snow adds to the feeling. The Lion King looks on &amp; Pepsi wishes them a Good &amp; Happy 2010.<br/>Huzzah, a keeper!</td>', 'A young couple, happy & oblivious in their affection for one another, surrounded by the Christmas hustle & bustle of the Big City that never sleeps. There is a vibrant, delightful, kinetic energy about this which gladdens the Heart and the newfallen snow adds to the feeling. The Lion King looks on & Pepsi wishes them a Good & Happy 2010.Huzzah, a keeper!', '2009-12-24 19:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780595, 840590, 111808, '<td valign="top">The expressions on the faces of these two brothers makes this a superb photograph. While you can tell that these two are not rich in money, they make up for it in with richness of the Heart. Beautifully captured interaction.</td>', 'The expressions on the faces of these two brothers makes this a superb photograph. While you can tell that these two are not rich in money, they make up for it in with richness of the Heart. Beautifully captured interaction.', '2009-12-24 19:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780598, 840405, 66635, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10.  (Any photo with a Yellow Lab always gets extra points!)</td>', 'Perfect 10.  (Any photo with a Yellow Lab always gets extra points!)', '2009-12-24 19:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780600, 840707, 111808, '<td valign="top">These three look for all the world like they are sharing the latest pond gossip. Delightful and funny.</td>', 'These three look for all the world like they are sharing the latest pond gossip. Delightful and funny.', '2009-12-24 19:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780601, 841233, 66635, '<td valign="top">I understand loving a pet; but just showing the object of one''s love doesn''t actually communicate that love photographically.  It kind of looks like you massively lowered the highlights or massively raised the shadows.  I can''t tell which.</td>', 'I understand loving a pet; but just showing the object of one''s love doesn''t actually communicate that love photographically.  It kind of looks like you massively lowered the highlights or massively raised the shadows.  I can''t tell which.', '2009-12-24 19:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780603, 841276, 111808, '<td valign="top">Dark..and disturbing, especially at Christmastime, although this aptly demonstrates an intensity of Love which some do not wish to contemplate.</td>', 'Dark..and disturbing, especially at Christmastime, although this aptly demonstrates an intensity of Love which some do not wish to contemplate.', '2009-12-24 19:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780604, 841073, 66635, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Me too.</td>', 'Cool.  Me too.', '2009-12-24 19:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780606, 841046, 66635, '<td valign="top">Well done, but I''ve seen this done before on DPC.  I think it would be more effective if the passage in focus spoke of love.</td>', 'Well done, but I''ve seen this done before on DPC.  I think it would be more effective if the passage in focus spoke of love.', '2009-12-24 19:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780607, 841227, 66635, '<td valign="top">I don''t like it because it is taken in a zoo.  All that manmade fake habitat takes away from the shot in a big way.  The lighting is also harsh.  But the otters are cute.</td>', 'I don''t like it because it is taken in a zoo.  All that manmade fake habitat takes away from the shot in a big way.  The lighting is also harsh.  But the otters are cute.', '2009-12-24 20:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780608, 841279, 66635, '<td valign="top">I don''t like studio shots; but the child''s action really makes this one good.</td>', 'I don''t like studio shots; but the child''s action really makes this one good.', '2009-12-24 20:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780610, 840540, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is GREAT - the little mouse looks so happy with his unexpected Christmas gift. Delightful, whimsical, touching, superb.</td>', 'This is GREAT - the little mouse looks so happy with his unexpected Christmas gift. Delightful, whimsical, touching, superb.', '2009-12-24 20:05:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5780614, 841109, 66635, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I like naked women and I appreciate the sexuality of the shot.  In fairness, though, I really have to DNMC it because I don''t think the whole vampire thing has anything to do with love even if it IS two hot naked chicks.  I know some will vote you down because of the sexuality.  I don''t do that.  But I do get strict on what I think meets the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  I like naked women and I appreciate the sexuality of the shot.  In fairness, though, I really have to DNMC it because I don''t think the whole vampire thing has anything to do with love even if it IS two hot naked chicks.  I know some will vote you down because of the sexuality.  I don''t do that.  But I do get strict on what I think meets the challenge.', '2009-12-24 20:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780616, 841209, 66635, '<td valign="top">If you can read French, some of the text on the left side is apt.</td>', 'If you can read French, some of the text on the left side is apt.', '2009-12-24 20:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780617, 840595, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful portrait as it captures the ages and lines of hard won years of wisdom and Life. Evocative, contemplative and the muted softer colours &amp; ridged fabric lines enhance the feeling of time spent and lost. The expression of the eyes in this is superb and I like how she still has flowers in her hair.</td>', 'This is a wonderful portrait as it captures the ages and lines of hard won years of wisdom and Life. Evocative, contemplative and the muted softer colours & ridged fabric lines enhance the feeling of time spent and lost. The expression of the eyes in this is superb and I like how she still has flowers in her hair.', '2009-12-24 20:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780619, 841255, 66635, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but I''m feeling pretty obligated to DNMC it because it doesn''t show anything about love.  There''s just "love" in the title.  You could have taken a picture of a shoe and titled it "I love my shoe" and it wouldn''t have been any different.  Ok, wait, I just noticed the rose.  That saved it.  It suggests someone loves her and that she may beel the same way.</td>', 'Great photo, but I''m feeling pretty obligated to DNMC it because it doesn''t show anything about love.  There''s just "love" in the title.  You could have taken a picture of a shoe and titled it "I love my shoe" and it wouldn''t have been any different.  Ok, wait, I just noticed the rose.  That saved it.  It suggests someone loves her and that she may beel the same way.', '2009-12-24 20:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780625, 840920, 66635, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Is this, in fact, a mating dance?  I wish I knew.  If it is, I would probably give it a high score.  If it isn''t, I''d have to DNMC it.  I''m torn; what will I do?  The open beak and the way the one on the right appears to be looking at the one on the left does suggest a paired relationship.  I might give you this one.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Is this, in fact, a mating dance?  I wish I knew.  If it is, I would probably give it a high score.  If it isn''t, I''d have to DNMC it.  I''m torn; what will I do?  The open beak and the way the one on the right appears to be looking at the one on the left does suggest a paired relationship.  I might give you this one.', '2009-12-24 20:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780626, 841112, 111808, '<td valign="top">We remember quietly in all the ways we can...Understated, heartfelt, recognised and superb. We are lines and lifelines, bricks and that in between which holds it all together. Walk on this and think of all which has been lost.</td>', 'We remember quietly in all the ways we can...Understated, heartfelt, recognised and superb. We are lines and lifelines, bricks and that in between which holds it all together. Walk on this and think of all which has been lost.', '2009-12-24 20:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780627, 841053, 66635, '<td valign="top">Dirty fingernails.</td>', 'Dirty fingernails.', '2009-12-24 20:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780628, 841228, 66635, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo.  Not sure about the love; but love the photo.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo.  Not sure about the love; but love the photo.', '2009-12-24 20:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
