(5782048, 841272, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, not sure of the love connection.  Appears to be an extreme wide angle lens, since the shadows converge on the center line.  Nice sky as well.  I really like the way two of the horses are side by side.</td>', 'Nice photo, not sure of the love connection.  Appears to be an extreme wide angle lens, since the shadows converge on the center line.  Nice sky as well.  I really like the way two of the horses are side by side.', '2009-12-26 22:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
