(5786452, 841109, 58691, '<td valign="top">It shocks me that this image finished so low. I certainly had it pegged for a top 10. Excellent shot, David. Too bad you''re not awarded points for views... clearly this image drew in a lot of onlookers.<br/> <br/>18 1s on this... that is truly insane.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-30 01:05:16.</i></td>', 'It shocks me that this image finished so low. I certainly had it pegged for a top 10. Excellent shot, David. Too bad you''re not awarded points for views... clearly this image drew in a lot of onlookers. 18 1s on this... that is truly insane.', '2009-12-30 00:53:56.000000', '2009-12-30 01:05:16.000000', 0),
