(5786582, 840540, 89230, '<td valign="top">wow. What a great photo. Thanks for explaining how you did that -Id probably try it in the future and get so upset that I couldnt get the animal to hold still, or hold the perfect expression. You truly deserve this ribbon after all that work  ;)</td>', 'wow. What a great photo. Thanks for explaining how you did that -Id probably try it in the future and get so upset that I couldnt get the animal to hold still, or hold the perfect expression. You truly deserve this ribbon after all that work  ;)', '2009-12-30 02:06:44.000000', NULL, 0),
