(5787543, 840540, 108580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DCNUTTER:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Magnum_za:</b></div><hr/><i> Cute and original in a sea of "ho hum" in this challenge. I hope this ribbons.<br/>PS: He looks half drowned! 10 in the interests of better photography :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Magnum..too funny! Poor little guy doesn''t look half drowned...he''s 100% drowned as we now know. RIP little buddy. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL! OK OK so I got the sex wrong :) How the hell does she know it''s a female anyway?<br/> <br/>Congrats Lydia, I am glad it ribboned. Now go see House. M.D. for your Vicadone.</td>', 'Originally posted by DCNUTTER: Originally posted by Magnum_za: Cute and original in a sea of "ho hum" in this challenge. I hope this ribbons.PS: He looks half drowned! 10 in the interests of better photography :)   Magnum..too funny! Poor little guy doesn''t look half drowned...he''s 100% drowned as we now know. RIP little buddy.   LOL! OK OK so I got the sex wrong :) How the hell does she know it''s a female anyway? Congrats Lydia, I am glad it ribboned. Now go see House. M.D. for your Vicadone.', '2009-12-30 15:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
